WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 18=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:43.079 --> 01:43.759
Young Master!

01:43.760 --> 01:44.639
Watch out!

02:14.000 --> 02:15.120
Cuique.

02:15.360 --> 02:16.519
Don't be afraid.

02:16.639 --> 02:17.918
Let Yinchen and Wei

02:17.919 --> 02:20.160
take you to Aunt Shunhua's
Rongzhang House.

02:20.400 --> 02:21.799
Once the imperial physician arrives,

02:21.840 --> 02:23.239
you'll get better.

02:24.199 --> 02:25.560
Don't worry about me.

02:26.159 --> 02:28.840
I'm staying
with First Madam and Xiushu.

02:33.120 --> 02:35.199
First Madam's household
authority tokens and seal

02:35.360 --> 02:36.600
are all here.

02:37.599 --> 02:38.720
As for this matter,

02:39.240 --> 02:40.680
Lanxiang, you handle it.

02:48.719 --> 02:49.840
Du Cuique,

02:50.240 --> 02:51.799
hand over the antidote.

02:54.872 --> 02:55.950
What are you talking about?

02:55.960 --> 02:57.160
I don't understand.

02:59.120 --> 03:00.158
Aren't you curious

03:00.159 --> 03:01.880
how you were poisoned?

03:06.919 --> 03:09.160
Even if I've acted
improperly in the past

03:09.240 --> 03:10.720
and offended you,

03:12.039 --> 03:13.198
look at the state I'm in now.

03:13.199 --> 03:14.759
I'm already pitiful enough.

03:15.000 --> 03:16.359
Lanxiang,

03:16.840 --> 03:17.519
why must you

03:17.520 --> 03:19.560
make things harder
for someone in my condition?

03:20.400 --> 03:22.160
You must have guessed

03:22.200 --> 03:24.560
there was something wrong
with the tea you drank earlier.

03:25.759 --> 03:27.239
But do you know where

03:27.240 --> 03:28.959
the poison in the tea came from?

03:32.840 --> 03:34.160
Last night,

03:34.520 --> 03:35.878
Young Master didn't bathe at all

03:35.879 --> 03:37.199
before going out.

03:40.120 --> 03:41.759
The water used to make your tea

03:42.039 --> 03:44.600
was the hot water
you prepared for Young Master.

03:46.360 --> 03:49.160
Baogai reheated it and made tea with it.

03:49.319 --> 03:51.560
Gantang served it right back to you.

03:54.800 --> 03:57.759
You thought Young Master had already
fallen ill and lost consciousness.

03:58.440 --> 04:00.830
You thought if you could
just hold out a little longer,

04:00.840 --> 04:02.560
someone would come to save you.

04:03.719 --> 04:04.839
Young Lady Du,

04:04.840 --> 04:06.000
I'm sorry

04:06.039 --> 04:07.600
to disappoint you.

04:08.599 --> 04:11.280
Young Master is perfectly well
and out there right now.

04:11.960 --> 04:13.638
He may even be dealing with

04:13.639 --> 04:16.800
the benefactor who gave you
the Yunzi stones and Xinggu gauze.

04:21.240 --> 04:22.360
You...

04:23.560 --> 04:25.199
You're wondering how I know

04:25.360 --> 04:26.800
and how much I know?

04:30.000 --> 04:32.480
When you were bent on climbing higher,

04:33.040 --> 04:35.000
you never bothered to look down.

04:35.600 --> 04:37.880
But everything you eat, wear, and use

04:38.040 --> 04:39.599
passes through the hands of

04:39.600 --> 04:41.199
lowly maids like us.

04:42.120 --> 04:43.759
We saw it all.

04:45.319 --> 04:47.519
You had Lingdang poison the hot water.

04:47.759 --> 04:49.199
Tongcao saw it.

04:50.160 --> 04:51.759
You accepted the Yunzi stones.

04:51.920 --> 04:53.639
Xiaolian saw it.

04:53.920 --> 04:56.120
You wore an undershirt
made of Xinggu gauze.

04:56.600 --> 04:58.279
Gantang saw it.

05:06.439 --> 05:07.399
Xiuwan!

05:10.199 --> 05:12.039
Zheng saved Jinqi's life.

05:12.040 --> 05:13.959
Cuique is an honored guest
of our Lin Residence.

05:14.664 --> 05:16.710
You lowly maid, how dare
you spout such nonsense

05:16.720 --> 05:18.104
and make these vicious accusations!

05:18.160 --> 05:19.638
I'll slap that mouth of yours bloody!

05:19.639 --> 05:20.759
Xiuwan.

05:23.120 --> 05:24.759
They're not good people at all.

05:26.519 --> 05:27.920
I saw it.

05:28.480 --> 05:30.279
The cave beneath
Enduring the Cold Pavilion.

05:43.439 --> 05:44.959
You helped Du Cuique.

05:45.240 --> 05:46.679
What is she to you?

05:46.680 --> 05:48.240
Did you ever think about us?

05:48.399 --> 05:49.398
If you do that,

05:49.399 --> 05:51.078
what will happen to Xiushu and me?

05:51.079 --> 05:52.639
What about our eldest sister?

05:57.439 --> 05:58.360
Xiuwan.

06:00.600 --> 06:01.560
Jinqiao.

06:01.800 --> 06:03.560
Go bring your sister back.

06:20.190 --> 06:22.008
To create the illusion of an epidemic,

06:22.072 --> 06:24.390
you always administered the poison
through the bathwater.

06:24.920 --> 06:26.399
But when you realized

06:26.439 --> 06:27.518
I suspected you,

06:27.519 --> 06:29.120
you killed Lingdang.

06:33.319 --> 06:34.719
If I'm right,

06:35.040 --> 06:36.398
the poison you gave Lingdang

06:36.399 --> 06:38.159
was put in her food.

06:38.360 --> 06:40.959
She ate it without suspecting a thing.

06:43.639 --> 06:44.759
Lanxiang.

06:47.120 --> 06:48.638
I simply did the same

06:48.639 --> 06:50.320
and made tea with the water

06:50.680 --> 06:52.880
you poisoned for you to drink.

06:53.920 --> 06:55.959
You want to outlast First Madam,

06:56.040 --> 06:57.560
but can you?

06:58.000 --> 07:00.480
First Madam didn't ingest the poison.

07:05.439 --> 07:06.680
Du Cuique,

07:07.560 --> 07:09.719
you're exceptionally
talented and meticulous.

07:09.720 --> 07:11.480
What a brilliant strategist you are.

07:11.752 --> 07:12.950
Now that it's come to this,

07:12.959 --> 07:14.839
why lose your dignity by denying it?

07:15.240 --> 07:16.920
Congyi saved Jinqi's life.

07:17.639 --> 07:19.078
As long as you hand over the antidote

07:19.079 --> 07:20.279
and everyone is safe,

07:21.040 --> 07:23.000
I promise the Lin family
won't pursue the matter.

07:23.639 --> 07:25.880
We'll consider
your lifesaving favor repaid.

07:31.240 --> 07:32.360
That's right.

07:34.120 --> 07:35.480
This isn't an illness.

07:35.959 --> 07:37.079
It's poison.

07:39.560 --> 07:41.000
I poisoned them.

07:48.120 --> 07:49.240
The antidote?

07:50.839 --> 07:52.079
I don't have it.

08:00.040 --> 08:02.599
I never expected to be poisoned myself.

08:02.839 --> 08:05.560
Why would I prepare an antidote?

08:07.199 --> 08:08.320
However,

08:09.360 --> 08:11.480
I do have the formula for the antidote.

08:14.439 --> 08:16.279
Hand over the formula.

08:20.439 --> 08:22.560
What do you take me for?

08:23.639 --> 08:25.920
Some petty thief?

08:26.519 --> 08:28.838
You think poisoning me

08:28.839 --> 08:30.638
will frighten me out of my wits

08:30.639 --> 08:33.160
and force me to hand over
the antidote to save my life?

08:36.039 --> 08:37.359
Xu Lanxiang,

08:38.919 --> 08:40.959
you've misjudged me.

08:44.519 --> 08:45.918
Since I chose this path,

08:45.919 --> 08:47.520
I was never afraid.

08:49.720 --> 08:51.758
I'm not afraid to take another's life,

08:51.759 --> 08:53.959
much less have someone take mine.

09:06.639 --> 09:08.400
You need the antidote,

09:08.720 --> 09:11.158
so you didn't dare give me a heavy dose

09:11.159 --> 09:13.520
in case I died like Lingdang.

09:15.559 --> 09:17.959
No matter how desperate I become,

09:18.519 --> 09:19.959
that Yuchan

09:20.120 --> 09:22.400
will die before I do.

09:23.919 --> 09:27.160
But Yuchan has no grievance with me.

09:28.039 --> 09:30.520
I never intended to kill her.

09:31.200 --> 09:32.999
The one I wanted dead

09:33.720 --> 09:35.400
was you.

09:36.039 --> 09:36.839
She

09:37.519 --> 09:40.199
is dying in your place.

09:54.120 --> 09:55.398
That wretched old woman Qin

09:55.399 --> 09:57.079
looked down on me, didn't she?

09:57.559 --> 09:58.440
Fine.

09:59.639 --> 10:02.359
Then she can die with her daughter
and keep me company.

10:03.120 --> 10:04.959
Even if Lin Jinqi is alive,

10:05.000 --> 10:06.680
what difference does it make?

10:07.200 --> 10:08.599
He caused his mother's death

10:08.600 --> 10:10.280
and his sister's death.

10:11.840 --> 10:13.239
For the rest of his life,

10:13.360 --> 10:15.800
does he think he'll ever live in peace?

10:19.000 --> 10:20.398
What are you after?

10:20.399 --> 10:21.680
What am I after?

10:23.759 --> 10:26.560
How could the small-minded
understand great ambitions?

10:29.440 --> 10:31.680
With so many people in the Lin Residence

10:31.720 --> 10:33.680
dying along with me,

10:35.559 --> 10:37.040
I'd say it's worth it.

10:39.639 --> 10:41.040
But Xu Lanxiang,

10:41.080 --> 10:42.680
remember this.

10:43.000 --> 10:45.079
You're the one who poisoned me.

10:45.399 --> 10:47.760
That's why they won't get the antidote.

10:49.000 --> 10:50.359
They...

10:52.399 --> 10:54.760
will all die because of you.

11:26.440 --> 11:27.719
You're wrong.

11:28.919 --> 11:30.560
I saved them.

11:32.520 --> 11:34.320
The only person you can poison to death

11:35.039 --> 11:36.440
is yourself.

12:42.120 --> 12:43.959
- First Madam!
- First Madam!

12:55.159 --> 12:56.760
Thanks to Lanxiang,

12:57.120 --> 12:58.920
we got the antidote.

12:59.919 --> 13:01.800
Concubine Zhou and I
were only mildly poisoned.

13:01.840 --> 13:03.560
We recovered after taking the antidote.

13:04.240 --> 13:05.918
The others were more severely poisoned.

13:05.919 --> 13:08.280
They'll need some time to recuperate,

13:08.360 --> 13:10.479
but they're all out of danger now.

13:20.120 --> 13:21.239
How...

13:22.120 --> 13:23.800
How can this be?

13:24.960 --> 13:26.199
Impossible.

13:26.200 --> 13:27.520
Last night,

13:27.639 --> 13:29.999
Lanxiang had Nanke
take the poisoned water

13:30.000 --> 13:31.719
to the Imperial Medical Service.

13:31.896 --> 13:33.336
Your poisoning method may be devious

13:33.350 --> 13:36.070
and based on a secret technique
from the southern borderlands,

13:36.080 --> 13:37.750
but this is Jinling,
the Southern Capital,

13:37.759 --> 13:39.400
where skilled experts abound.

13:39.840 --> 13:42.959
The Imperial Medical Service even has
a physician from Yunnan Prefecture.

13:43.159 --> 13:44.758
Once they had a sample of your poison,

13:44.759 --> 13:47.079
how could they fail
to formulate an antidote?

13:47.399 --> 13:48.398
Right now,

13:48.399 --> 13:50.800
they're busy treating
the patients in Fengqi Courtyard.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.079
Later,

13:52.200 --> 13:54.599
they'd also like
to compare notes with you.

14:00.559 --> 14:02.359
Please apologize
to the imperial physicians

14:02.360 --> 14:04.160
on my behalf.

14:05.960 --> 14:07.760
I'm afraid I'll have to leave first.

14:08.559 --> 14:10.640
I won't have time to speak with them.

14:12.472 --> 14:14.190
Ever since you entered this residence,

14:14.559 --> 14:16.999
I've never treated you unfairly.

14:17.559 --> 14:20.479
Even though I didn't want you
to become Jinqi's concubine,

14:21.000 --> 14:23.638
I still looked everywhere
for a well-off family for you

14:23.639 --> 14:25.879
and tried to arrange
a good marriage for you.

14:26.639 --> 14:27.719
Why do you

14:28.559 --> 14:30.959
hate our Lin family so much?

14:32.000 --> 14:33.599
A well-off family?

14:34.600 --> 14:36.479
A good marriage?

14:37.639 --> 14:39.320
Let me guess.

14:40.440 --> 14:41.920
It would probably be

14:42.120 --> 14:45.560
a farming family
with some land of their own.

14:50.759 --> 14:52.280
A family like that

14:52.519 --> 14:54.959
would have struggled
to put one son through his studies.

14:55.200 --> 14:57.839
He couldn't marry a proper young lady
from a prominent family,

14:57.840 --> 14:59.680
but then along comes someone like me,

15:00.120 --> 15:02.359
someone with ties to the Lin Residence.

15:03.919 --> 15:05.560
Once I married into the family,

15:05.720 --> 15:07.400
I'd have to manage the household,

15:07.639 --> 15:08.758
be a dutiful daughter-in-law,

15:08.759 --> 15:11.119
bear and raise children,
get along with my sisters-in-law,

15:11.639 --> 15:13.999
and use my ties to the Lin Residence

15:14.000 --> 15:16.199
to help my husband build connections.

15:18.840 --> 15:20.119
I might even

15:20.320 --> 15:22.959
have to spend my entire dowry

15:22.960 --> 15:25.278
to help my husband
rise through the ranks.

15:25.279 --> 15:26.160
This is

15:27.039 --> 15:29.680
what you call a good marriage?

15:31.799 --> 15:33.560
What's wrong with that?

15:33.992 --> 15:36.760
Don't you want your husband to rise in
rank and become an official?

15:36.840 --> 15:38.239
If I want wealth and status,

15:38.240 --> 15:40.320
why would I marry
into a family like that?

15:42.639 --> 15:44.199
Am I out of my mind?

15:45.320 --> 15:46.638
I'd bring my dowry with me

15:46.639 --> 15:48.520
only to work myself
to the bone for them.

15:49.600 --> 15:51.800
If I have to marry anyway,

15:52.720 --> 15:54.760
I'll marry into a wealthy
and powerful family.

15:55.440 --> 15:57.599
If the Lin family won't accept me,

15:58.360 --> 16:00.760
another prominent family will.

16:03.120 --> 16:06.560
Water flows downward,
while people strive to rise.

16:07.200 --> 16:09.359
There's nothing wrong with wanting

16:09.360 --> 16:10.560
success, wealth, and status.

16:10.759 --> 16:12.959
But you shouldn't
resort to underhanded means!

16:19.759 --> 16:22.199
Then let me ask you, First Madam,

16:22.440 --> 16:24.398
what other open road is there

16:24.399 --> 16:26.160
for someone like me?

16:28.000 --> 16:31.119
My talent and learning
are no less than any man's.

16:33.200 --> 16:36.760
But can I take the imperial examination
and become the top scholar?

16:36.960 --> 16:40.160
Or can I join the army
and win a noble title through battle?

16:42.720 --> 16:44.280
Other than marriage,

16:45.600 --> 16:48.119
what other path has this world

16:48.840 --> 16:51.160
left for a woman like me?

16:54.159 --> 16:55.800
Haven't you simply decided

16:56.519 --> 16:58.959
that marrying me off well

16:59.639 --> 17:03.359
would repay my brother
for saving Jinqi's life?

17:07.240 --> 17:08.960
What's wrong with getting married?

17:10.160 --> 17:11.639
What else can a woman do

17:11.640 --> 17:13.200
if she doesn't marry?

17:15.759 --> 17:17.000
How pitiful.

17:18.759 --> 17:20.520
How truly pitiful.

17:22.519 --> 17:24.560
You really are pitiful.

17:32.400 --> 17:33.760
What are you laughing at?

17:35.960 --> 17:38.000
What's so wrong with getting married?

17:39.640 --> 17:41.159
What's so pitiful about it?

18:17.920 --> 18:20.359
A woman was born amid
the chaos of the previous dynasty.

18:20.960 --> 18:23.320
At twelve or thirteen,
she was sold as a child bride.

18:24.039 --> 18:26.639
Unable to endure her in-laws' abuse,

18:26.640 --> 18:27.639
she ran away

18:27.640 --> 18:29.000
and eventually ended up in Yazhou.

18:29.640 --> 18:31.639
But she never gave up on herself.

18:31.759 --> 18:34.159
She learned weaving from the local women

18:34.279 --> 18:35.879
and worked hard to support herself.

18:41.759 --> 18:43.320
A woman like that

18:44.359 --> 18:46.000
would drift aimlessly

18:46.279 --> 18:48.040
or live a life of drudgery.

18:49.640 --> 18:50.838
After she passed away,

18:50.839 --> 18:52.560
cotton became widely cultivated.

18:52.680 --> 18:53.679
The local women,

18:53.680 --> 18:55.598
using the techniques
she had taught them,

18:55.599 --> 18:58.200
wove Songjiang cloth that
became renowned throughout the land.

19:01.359 --> 19:02.798
In Songjiang Prefecture,

19:02.799 --> 19:06.079
the people built a shrine to honor her,

19:06.240 --> 19:07.760
and offerings have never ceased.

19:14.720 --> 19:16.119
A woman

19:17.200 --> 19:18.960
could be revered like a sage,

19:20.759 --> 19:22.439
her name remembered in history...

19:23.759 --> 19:25.040
Offerings...

19:25.279 --> 19:27.000
Offerings at a shrine?

19:29.920 --> 19:31.639
Her name was Huang Daopo.

19:31.640 --> 19:33.320
Perhaps you've never heard of her,

19:33.480 --> 19:35.224
but you've certainly used

19:35.240 --> 19:37.240
the Songjiang cloth she passed down.

19:37.640 --> 19:40.719
Her divine titles, the Weaver Star
and First Deity of Cotton,

19:40.720 --> 19:42.359
are ones you've surely worshiped, too.

20:02.200 --> 20:03.760
Lanxiang is right.

20:06.599 --> 20:07.839
Du Cuique,

20:08.920 --> 20:11.520
don't blame everything
on an unjust world.

20:12.072 --> 20:13.550
No matter how unjust the world may be,

20:13.559 --> 20:15.760
you still have to live
with honor and integrity.

20:16.279 --> 20:18.240
You're simply consumed by greed

20:18.310 --> 20:20.104
and want everything
without working for it.

20:26.340 --> 20:30.660
♪If there were a promise♪

20:31.599 --> 20:32.720
Wei.

20:34.000 --> 20:35.240
Give her the antidote.

20:35.559 --> 20:38.040
We can't let her die like this
in the Lin Residence.

20:38.759 --> 20:39.879
I won't drink it.

20:40.000 --> 20:41.119
I don't want it.

20:41.480 --> 20:42.760
I won't take the medicine!

20:44.119 --> 20:46.560
I won't drink it!

20:46.680 --> 20:47.639
I won't drink it!

20:47.640 --> 20:48.399
I won't drink it!

20:48.400 --> 20:49.520
I won't drink it!

20:49.720 --> 20:50.879
I won't drink it!

20:53.119 --> 20:54.239
Let me die!

20:54.240 --> 20:55.239
Let me die!

20:55.240 --> 20:56.038
No!

20:56.039 --> 20:56.879
I won't drink it!

20:56.880 --> 20:58.159
I won't drink it!

20:59.460 --> 21:01.979
♪Memories hide away again♪

21:01.980 --> 21:06.179
♪Silent, yet they never stop shining♪

21:06.180 --> 21:08.340
♪Still burning bright♪

21:12.119 --> 21:13.159
Take her away.

21:13.279 --> 21:14.560
Hand her over to the authorities.

21:16.319 --> 21:17.679
Xu Lanxiang!

21:17.880 --> 21:19.679
Xu Lanxiang!

21:20.960 --> 21:22.520
Xu Lanxiang!

21:22.960 --> 21:25.159
Even as a ghost, I'll never let you go!

21:25.200 --> 21:26.599
Xu Lanxiang!

21:27.000 --> 21:28.280
Xu Lanxiang!

21:28.880 --> 21:30.520
Xu Lanxiang!

21:32.960 --> 21:35.000
Xu Lanxiang!

21:36.000 --> 21:38.159
Even as a ghost, I'll never let you go!

21:39.359 --> 21:40.760
Xu Lanxiang!

21:42.079 --> 21:43.919
Even as a ghost, I'll never let you go!

21:44.400 --> 21:46.679
Even as a ghost, I'll never let you go!

21:46.799 --> 21:48.119
Xu Lanxiang!

21:49.039 --> 21:51.520
Even as a ghost, I'll never let you go!

21:52.480 --> 21:54.000
Xu Lanxiang!

21:54.319 --> 21:56.879
I'll never let you go!

21:58.319 --> 22:00.000
Xu Lanxiang!

22:00.440 --> 22:02.480
Xu Lanxiang!

22:03.279 --> 22:06.560
Even as a ghost, I'll never let you go!

22:06.720 --> 22:09.040
Xu Lanxiang!

22:31.200 --> 22:32.240
First Madam.

22:33.759 --> 22:36.359
Yuchan, Xiaolian,
Madam Wu, and the others

22:36.400 --> 22:37.760
are really all right?

22:39.400 --> 22:40.599
Don't worry.

22:40.839 --> 22:42.560
The imperial physicians arrived in time.

22:42.799 --> 22:44.200
They're all fine.

23:16.880 --> 23:18.399
We helped, too.

23:42.660 --> 23:47.598
(Prison)

23:47.599 --> 23:48.119
Move.

23:48.640 --> 23:49.159
Move.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.599
Forgive us, Registrar Dai.

23:55.440 --> 23:56.520
Behave yourself.

24:42.720 --> 24:44.040
Why?

24:55.880 --> 24:57.280
Why?

25:17.359 --> 25:18.760
Why?

26:17.860 --> 26:25.140
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

26:25.620 --> 26:33.100
♪The encounters of half a lifetime
are kept within this little world♪

26:33.180 --> 26:39.820
♪Bit by bit, the passing years
become the preface♪

26:40.500 --> 26:43.340
♪The joys and sorrows
of the past quietly dwell here♪

26:46.319 --> 26:47.320
Congyi.

26:48.500 --> 26:53.019
♪With my own hands and heart♪

26:53.020 --> 26:56.700
♪I write my name♪

26:57.020 --> 27:03.980
♪Through countless lines of ink,
step by step toward the light♪

27:06.799 --> 27:08.439
Commander Yuan's archery

27:08.440 --> 27:10.199
is renowned.

27:10.200 --> 27:12.359
A single arrow struck a vital spot.

27:12.480 --> 27:15.000
His internal organs
are damaged and bleeding.

27:15.319 --> 27:17.598
I can only tend to his wound

27:17.599 --> 27:19.560
and apply some pain-relieving powder

27:19.799 --> 27:22.240
to ease his pain a little.

27:23.288 --> 27:24.960
Thank you, Imperial Physician Zhou.

27:37.839 --> 27:39.000
Congyi.

27:45.480 --> 27:47.040
Cuique...

27:48.400 --> 27:50.439
Did Cuique...

27:53.559 --> 27:55.240
succeed?

27:58.559 --> 27:59.280
The Lin...

28:00.680 --> 28:02.200
The Lin family...

28:04.880 --> 28:06.639
is dead...

28:53.759 --> 28:54.798
Assistant Commander Lin.

28:54.799 --> 28:55.879
Thank you for your efforts.

28:59.119 --> 29:00.240
Take good care of him.

29:00.312 --> 29:01.816
Rest assured, Assistant Commander Lin.

29:01.960 --> 29:03.520
I'll see that he's well cared for.

29:23.200 --> 29:24.199
Have a drink!

29:24.200 --> 29:25.439
Have a drink!

29:25.440 --> 29:26.239
Have a drink!

29:26.240 --> 29:27.399
Let's all have a drink!

29:27.400 --> 29:28.118
Drink up!

29:28.119 --> 29:29.960
- Have a drink!
- Have a drink!

29:32.640 --> 29:34.000
Drink up.

29:34.440 --> 29:34.919
Come on.

29:34.920 --> 29:36.639
Fill everyone's cup.

29:37.000 --> 29:37.879
Baogai.

29:37.880 --> 29:39.479
You did a great service.

29:39.480 --> 29:41.558
You should eat more.

29:41.559 --> 29:43.159
Gantang did a great service, too.

29:43.160 --> 29:44.639
Gantang, you should eat more, too.

29:44.640 --> 29:46.479
I can't drink anymore.

29:46.480 --> 29:48.960
If I drink any more,
it'll interfere with tomorrow's work.

29:49.359 --> 29:50.358
Everyone.

29:50.359 --> 29:51.399
First Madam said

29:51.400 --> 29:52.639
this banquet today

29:52.640 --> 29:53.838
is a reward for us.

29:53.839 --> 29:55.359
We can drink as much as we like.

29:55.559 --> 29:56.719
Even I'm not afraid.

29:56.720 --> 29:58.079
What are you afraid of?

29:59.400 --> 29:59.959
Have a drink.

29:59.960 --> 30:01.960
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

30:04.359 --> 30:05.480
Have a drink.

30:05.720 --> 30:07.959
- A toast to First Madam.
- Thank you for the reward.

30:07.960 --> 30:08.838
Come on.

30:08.839 --> 30:10.000
Here.

30:14.559 --> 30:16.159
Fill them up.

30:16.280 --> 30:17.830
This is fine liquor from First Madam.

30:17.839 --> 30:18.959
Don't waste it. Fill them up.

30:18.960 --> 30:20.439
Fill them up.

30:20.440 --> 30:22.879
- Come on, drink up!
- Drink up!

30:26.039 --> 30:28.760
Lanxiang deserves the most credit.
You should eat more today.

30:29.480 --> 30:31.079
Let's have another drink.

30:31.240 --> 30:33.159
Lanxiang, let's have
another drink together.

30:43.240 --> 30:43.919
Come on, hurry.

30:43.920 --> 30:45.318
Pour Lanxiang another cup.

30:45.319 --> 30:46.479
Tongcao is out of liquor, too.

30:46.480 --> 30:47.758
Go get another flask.

30:47.759 --> 30:48.558
I'll go.

30:48.559 --> 30:49.358
Come on.

30:49.359 --> 30:50.518
Fill them up.

30:50.519 --> 30:52.639
Don't just drink.
Have something to eat, too.

30:52.640 --> 30:54.120
I can't drink anymore. I really can't.

30:54.130 --> 30:55.096
I should toast you, too.

30:55.112 --> 30:56.320
I can't.

30:58.240 --> 31:01.359
Yuchan said her life

31:01.559 --> 31:05.639
was saved by Lanxiang, Baogai, Gantang,

31:05.640 --> 31:08.599
and Tongcao.

31:08.680 --> 31:12.639
Unfortunately, she still needs bed rest,

31:12.640 --> 31:15.239
so she asked me to make sure I

31:15.240 --> 31:17.760
have a few drinks with all of you
on her behalf tonight.

31:18.160 --> 31:18.999
Gantang.

31:19.000 --> 31:19.800
Young Master.

31:19.848 --> 31:20.870
Yuchan is all right now!

31:20.880 --> 31:23.959
We should drink more to Lanxiang.
She deserves the most credit.

31:23.960 --> 31:24.760
Right.

31:25.400 --> 31:27.639
I'll drink
three full bowls with Lanxiang.

31:31.559 --> 31:34.119
That's right, Lanxiang.

31:42.240 --> 31:43.480
You two stay here.

31:44.359 --> 31:46.119
Look who's here.

31:46.720 --> 31:47.720
Hua.

31:47.880 --> 31:52.118
You should drink three full cups
with Jiugao on Yuchan's behalf.

31:52.119 --> 31:53.439
These past few days,

31:53.440 --> 31:55.159
he's been running around

31:55.160 --> 31:56.879
and helping us a great deal.

31:58.240 --> 31:59.639
And Nanke, too.

31:59.640 --> 32:01.679
Everyone should drink
three full cups with him.

32:01.680 --> 32:04.518
Thanks to him sneaking in
without anyone noticing

32:04.519 --> 32:06.919
and then sneaking back out the same way.

32:08.720 --> 32:10.910
Come on. Let's each go drink
three full cups with them.

32:10.920 --> 32:11.838
All right. Let's go.

32:11.839 --> 32:13.199
Bring the liquor flasks.

32:13.200 --> 32:13.960
All right.

32:14.000 --> 32:14.919
Let's go.

32:14.920 --> 32:16.599
Off we go.

32:16.799 --> 32:17.719
Careful.

32:17.720 --> 32:20.480
Go have a good drink
with Jiugao and Nanke.

32:20.640 --> 32:21.838
Hurry and catch up.

32:21.839 --> 32:22.919
Hurry.

32:22.920 --> 32:25.078
Nanke! Jiugao!

32:25.079 --> 32:26.919
We're here to toast you!

32:27.200 --> 32:28.239
Come on, fill them up.

32:28.240 --> 32:29.280
The cups.

32:29.400 --> 32:30.430
I want to toast you, too.

32:30.440 --> 32:33.078
- Nanke!
- Nanke!

32:33.079 --> 32:34.278
I'll pour for you.

32:34.279 --> 32:35.479
One at a time.

32:35.480 --> 32:36.518
We'll each toast you once.

32:36.519 --> 32:38.750
Nanke deserves much of the credit.

32:38.759 --> 32:39.318
All of us

32:39.319 --> 32:40.639
should toast him first.

32:40.680 --> 32:41.720
All right.

32:44.839 --> 32:46.480
Drink!

32:49.039 --> 32:49.720
Drink!

33:11.599 --> 33:12.679
This time,

33:13.240 --> 33:14.560
it's all thanks to you.

33:17.319 --> 33:18.720
I'll always remember it

33:19.640 --> 33:20.800
and never forget.

33:23.064 --> 33:24.720
I'll drink first as a sign of respect.

33:42.599 --> 33:44.679
That's my cup.

33:52.720 --> 33:53.760
So?

33:58.319 --> 33:59.439
What?

34:00.079 --> 34:02.560
You'll drink when Yinchen
and the others toast you,

34:02.960 --> 34:04.280
but when I toast you,

34:04.400 --> 34:05.520
you won't drink?

34:06.519 --> 34:07.560
How about

34:08.039 --> 34:09.800
I call Yinchen and the others back

34:10.000 --> 34:12.479
and have each of them
toast you with a full cup?

34:13.159 --> 34:13.959
Yin...

34:33.559 --> 34:34.919
You're playing dirty.

34:41.199 --> 34:42.279
One more cup.

34:42.280 --> 34:43.158
One more cup.

34:43.159 --> 34:44.439
Drink.

34:44.440 --> 34:45.118
Drink.

34:45.119 --> 34:47.080
I can't drink anymore.

34:49.519 --> 34:50.559
I...

34:51.679 --> 34:52.959
have to get out of here.

36:04.540 --> 36:07.300
♪Look at us♪

36:07.620 --> 36:12.340
♪We've shared countless
beautiful moments♪

36:13.460 --> 36:18.980
♪Through life's winding road,
we've weathered countless trials♪

36:21.060 --> 36:27.860
♪I'm blessed to spend each
peaceful day and night with you♪

36:28.940 --> 36:31.460
♪However deep the joy or sorrow♪

36:31.900 --> 36:34.979
♪There will always
be someone to share it with♪

36:34.980 --> 36:38.260
♪Our bond runs deep♪

36:38.660 --> 36:41.900
♪Binding us closely together♪

36:42.220 --> 36:45.219
♪Washing away
the dust of this mortal world♪

36:45.220 --> 36:49.660
♪Even if we must part in the end♪

36:50.060 --> 36:53.899
♪I'll have no regrets
that we met in this life♪

36:53.900 --> 36:58.140
♪May we stay together until life's end♪

36:58.500 --> 37:01.659
♪Every sincerity you've shown me♪

37:01.660 --> 37:05.459
♪Has long taken root in my heart♪

37:05.460 --> 37:08.179
♪Our bond runs deep♪

37:08.180 --> 37:12.899
♪Binding us closely together♪

37:12.900 --> 37:15.539
♪After all
the questions life has brought♪

37:15.540 --> 37:19.980
♪This love has never
faded in the slightest♪

37:20.540 --> 37:23.959
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

37:23.960 --> 37:25.259
It smells wonderful.

37:25.260 --> 37:28.220
♪How fortunate to find
one person in a lifetime♪

37:29.599 --> 37:31.120
What flower is that fragrance from?

37:31.220 --> 37:36.780
♪My heart remains
as true to you as ever♪

37:37.199 --> 37:38.559
Orchids.

37:41.519 --> 37:44.439
Some orchids are most fragrant at noon.

37:44.760 --> 37:46.240
Other orchids

37:46.400 --> 37:47.879
are most fragrant at night.

38:00.400 --> 38:01.680
What are you doing?

38:02.840 --> 38:06.120
I want to smell the flowers.

38:38.239 --> 38:39.999
Which do you like better,

38:41.559 --> 38:43.120
the fragrance of flowers or silver?

38:45.199 --> 38:46.439
Silver.

38:50.920 --> 38:52.519
You're not too drunk to think straight.

38:57.000 --> 38:58.640
It's good to be alive.

38:59.880 --> 39:02.600
I can still smell the flowers.

39:10.119 --> 39:11.240
Congyi...

39:16.840 --> 39:18.479
Du Zheng is dying.

39:21.039 --> 39:23.039
Du Cuique must think

39:24.559 --> 39:26.439
I caused her brother's death.

39:30.199 --> 39:31.999
I wanted to repay them.

39:32.719 --> 39:34.680
I had Du Zheng transferred to Jinling

39:36.360 --> 39:38.359
and brought Du Cuique
into the residence.

39:42.719 --> 39:44.320
Was I wrong?

39:49.159 --> 39:50.680
You did nothing wrong.

39:52.239 --> 39:54.080
They were the ones in the wrong.

40:00.039 --> 40:02.120
They were too greedy.

40:04.599 --> 40:06.240
In this world,

40:06.679 --> 40:09.120
who doesn't want a better life?

40:10.719 --> 40:12.519
I'm greedy, too.

40:13.519 --> 40:15.720
But our forebears taught us,

40:16.159 --> 40:19.240
"A gentleman acquires
wealth by honorable means."

40:19.400 --> 40:21.919
You can't trample on others

40:21.920 --> 40:25.519
just because you want a better life.

40:35.039 --> 40:37.240
I don't think
I did anything wrong, either.

40:42.199 --> 40:43.720
But why

40:46.559 --> 40:48.320
do I still feel so awful?

40:54.159 --> 40:55.640
Because...

40:57.800 --> 40:58.919
you...

41:00.159 --> 41:02.320
are a good person.

41:05.740 --> 41:12.260
♪If you're a lone traveler
returning through the snow♪

41:18.400 --> 41:20.280
I'm a good person...

41:24.780 --> 41:28.900
♪If you're the silent fragrance
of a secluded orchid♪

41:33.039 --> 41:34.600
I like hearing that.

41:35.559 --> 41:36.558
Say it some more...

41:36.559 --> 41:41.660
♪Deep within the lights lies
a truth that came too late♪

41:43.940 --> 41:48.980
♪Even if these trials
consume my whole life♪

41:49.000 --> 41:50.078
You're really drunk.

41:50.079 --> 41:53.419
♪I'll only return
to the moment our fate began♪

41:53.420 --> 41:57.059
♪I've searched and searched,
wandering in circles♪

41:57.060 --> 42:00.019
♪Yet I can never mend that old dream♪

42:00.020 --> 42:02.979
♪Leaving only regret behind♪

42:02.980 --> 42:07.860
♪Thankfully, these trials
have spared me a lifetime♪

42:07.900 --> 42:13.300
♪In this life and the next,
it will always be you♪

42:13.700 --> 42:21.980
♪I only pray that fate
lets us meet sooner♪

42:35.940 --> 42:38.780
(Your pay and provisions
come from the people's toil.)

42:41.320 --> 42:44.280
Liang Yu, Commander
of the Shence Garrison,

42:44.760 --> 42:46.600
has enjoyed His Majesty's favor,

42:47.039 --> 42:49.038
yet gave no thought
to serving the realm.

42:49.039 --> 42:50.919
He colluded with Dai Rong

42:51.039 --> 42:53.120
and formed a faction for personal gain.

42:53.440 --> 42:54.919
He disregarded the greater good

42:54.920 --> 42:56.720
and pursued his own interests.

42:57.239 --> 43:01.359
He is hereby stripped
of office and imprisoned.

43:05.060 --> 43:07.780
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.056 --> 43:10.350
First Madam, Young Master,
for all you've done for us,

43:10.360 --> 43:12.759
our whole family will always
remember your kindness.

43:12.760 --> 43:14.479
Every day,
we'll kowtow to the Bodhisattva

43:14.480 --> 43:16.100
and pray
for the Bodhisattva's blessings.

43:16.110 --> 43:17.959
May First Madam
be blessed with many descendants

43:17.960 --> 43:19.384
and an ever-flourishing family line.

43:19.416 --> 43:21.510
May Young Master
be blessed with a destined match

43:21.519 --> 43:22.919
and a marriage made in heaven.

43:26.239 --> 43:27.039
Yes.

43:27.079 --> 43:29.640
Every day, we'll kowtow
and burn incense to the Bodhisattva

43:29.679 --> 43:30.558
and pray
for the Bodhisattva's blessings.

43:30.559 --> 43:31.158
May...

43:31.159 --> 43:32.879
May the Bodhisattva bless you.

43:34.440 --> 43:35.999
You certainly have a way with words.

43:36.440 --> 43:37.640
What you said

43:37.760 --> 43:39.680
is exactly what
First Madam and I wish for.

43:40.392 --> 43:41.870
May your auspicious words come true.

43:41.880 --> 43:43.120
I hope that someday,

43:43.230 --> 43:44.984
everything will turn out
just as we wish.

44:01.461 --> 44:05.581
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:08.421 --> 44:12.941
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:14.221 --> 44:18.141
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:18.821 --> 44:21.581
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:22.301 --> 44:24.621
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:24.621 --> 44:27.701
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:29.221 --> 44:33.461
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:36.381 --> 44:40.541
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:42.341 --> 44:45.901
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:45.901 --> 44:49.461
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:50.261 --> 44:55.941
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:56.301 --> 45:00.621
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:00.981 --> 45:03.941
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:03.941 --> 45:07.701
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:07.701 --> 45:10.581
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:10.581 --> 45:14.661
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:14.661 --> 45:18.021
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:18.021 --> 45:21.781
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:21.781 --> 45:25.781
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:26.541 --> 45:30.701
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:30.701 --> 45:34.141
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:34.141 --> 45:37.781
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:37.781 --> 45:40.661
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:40.661 --> 45:44.741
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:44.741 --> 45:48.101
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:48.101 --> 45:51.741
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:51.741 --> 45:59.541
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
